#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<P>\n"
"There is a lot of information about KDE on the\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.kde.org/\">KDE web site</A>. There are\n"
"also useful sites for major applications like\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.konqueror.org/\">Konqueror</A>,\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.koffice.org/\">KOffice</A> and\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.kdevelop.org/\">KDevelop</A>.\n"
"</P>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/places/user-desktop.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>\n"
"Hai moita información acerca de KDE no\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.kde.org/\">sitio web de KDE </A>. Hai\n"
"tamén sitios de grande utilidade para os programas máis importantes como\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.konqueror.org/\">Konqueror</A>, \n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.koffice.org/\">KOffice</A> and\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.kdevelop.org/\">KDevelop</A>.\n"
"</P>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/places/user-desktop.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:19
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE is translated into many languages. You can change the country and\n"
"language with the System Settings by selecting \"Regional and Language\".\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>For more information about KDE translations and translators, see <a\n"
"href=\"http://l10n.kde.org/\">http://l10n.kde.org</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/preferences-desktop-locale.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE está traducido a moitas linguas. Pode cambiar o país e a lingua\n"
"na Configuración do Sistema en \"Rexional e acesibilidade\".\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Para máis información acerca das traducións de KDE e dos tradutores,\n"
"consulte <a\n"
"href=\"http://l10n.kde.org/\">http://l10n.kde.org</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/preferences-desktop-locale.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:34
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"The program Klipper, which is started by default and resides in the\n"
"system tray, keeps a number of text\n"
"selections around. These can be retrieved or even (in the case of\n"
"URLs, for example) be executed.</p>\n"
"<p>You can find more information about using Klipper in <a\n"
"href=\"help:/klipper\">the Klipper Handbook</a></p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/klipper.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"O programa klipper, que se executa por omisión e que se coloca na bandexa\n"
"do sistema á dereita do painel, garda un conxunto de seleccións de texto,\n"
"que poden recuperarse ou mesmo (p.ex., no caso de URLs) executarse.</p>\n"
"<p>Pode atopar máis información acerca do uso de Klipper no <a\n"
"href=\"help:/klipper\">manual de Klipper</a></p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/klipper.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:49
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Double-clicking on the titlebar of any window \"shades\" it, which means\n"
"that only the titlebar stays visible. Double-clicking the titlebar a\n"
"second time will make the window visible again.<br>\n"
"Of course, you can change this behavior within the System Settings.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>For more information about ways to manipulate windows in KDE, take\n"
"a look at <a href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/windows-how-to-work.html"
"\">the KDE User Guide</a>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Se fai un duplo-click na barra de título dunha fiestra, esta enrólase, o\n"
"que quere dicir que só fica visíbel a barra do título. Se volta facer\n"
"duplo-click, a fiestra faise visíbel de novo.<br>\n"
"Por suposto, pode cambiar este comportamento na Configuración do Sistema.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Para ter máis información acerca de como manipular as fiestras en KDE,\n"
"consulte <a href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/windows-how-to-work.html\">a "
"guía do usuario de KDE</a>.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:61
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can cycle through the windows on a virtual desktop by holding the\n"
"Alt key and pressing Tab or Shift+Tab.</p><br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/places/user-desktop.png\"></center></p>\n"
"<p>For more information, see \n"
"<a href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/windows-how-to-work.html\">the KDE\n"
"User Guide</a>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Pode circular polas fiestras dun escritorio virtual mantendo a tecla Alt e\n"
"premendo Tab ou Shift-Tab.</p><br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/places/user-desktop.png\"></center></p>\n"
"<p>Para máis información, consulte \n"
"<<a href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/windows-how-to-work.html\">a guía do "
"usuario de KDE</a>.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:72
msgid ""
"<p>The KDE project was founded in October 1996 and had its first release,\n"
"1.0, on July 12, 1998.</p>\n"
"<p>You can <em>support the KDE project</em> with work (programming, "
"designing,\n"
"documenting, proof-reading, translating, etc.) and financial or\n"
"hardware donations. Please contact <a\n"
" href=\"mailto:kde-ev@kde.org\">kde-ev@kde.org</a>\n"
"if you are interested in donating, or <a\n"
"href=\"mailto:kde-quality@kde.org\">kde-quality@kde.org</a> if you would\n"
"like to contribute in other ways.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>O proxecto KDE foi fundado en Outubro de 1996 e produciu a súa primeira "
"versión,\n"
"a 1.0, o 12 de xullo de 1998.</p>\n"
"<p>Pode <em>axudar ao proxecto KDE</em> con traballo (programación, deseño,\n"
"documentación, correcións, traduccións, etc.) e doazóns monetarias ou\n"
"de hardware. Por favor, se está interesado, contacte con <a \n"
"href=\"mailto:kde-ev@kde.org\">kde-ev@kde.org</a> \n"
"se está interesado en doar, ou <a\n"
"href=\"mailto:kde-quality@kde.org\">kde-quality@kde.org</a> se desexa\n"
"axudar doutro xeito.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:85
msgid ""
"<p>KDE provides some shortcuts to change the size of a window:</p>\n"
"<table><tr>\n"
"<th>To maximize a window...</th>\t<th>click the maximize button...</th>\n"
"</tr><tr>\n"
"<td>...full-screen,</td>\t\t<td>...with the left mouse button</td>\n"
"</tr><tr>\n"
"<td>...vertically only,</td>\t<td>...with the middle mouse button</td>\n"
"</tr><tr>\n"
"<td>...horizontally only,</td>\t<td>...with the right mouse button</td>\n"
"</tr></table>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>KDE fornece algúns atallos para mudar o tamaño dunha fiestra:</p>\n"
"<table><tr>\n"
"<th>Para maximizar unha fiestra...</th>\t<th>Prema o botón de maximizar...</"
"th>\n"
"</tr><tr>\n"
"<td>...pantalla completa,</td>\t\t<td>...co botón principal do rato</td>\n"
"</tr><tr>\n"
"<td>...só verticalmente</td>\t<td>...co botón central do rato</td>\n"
"</tr><tr>\n"
"<td>...só horizontalmente</td>\t<td>co botón secundario do rato</td>\n"
"</tr></table>\n"

#: tips.cpp:99
msgid ""
"<p>You can stay up to date with new developments in KDE and releases\n"
"by regularly checking the web site <A\n"
" HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</A>.</p>\n"
"<BR>\n"
"<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Pode manterse actualizado cos novos desenvolvementos de KDE\n"
"comprobando de cando en vez a páxina web <A\n"
" HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</A>.</p>\n"
"<BR>\n"
"<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:108
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE is based on a well-designed C++ foundation. C++ is a programming\n"
"language well suited to desktop development. The KDE object model\n"
"extends the power of C++ even further. See\n"
" <a href=\"http://techbase.kde.org/\">http://techbase.kde.org/</a>\n"
"for details.</p><br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE está baseado nunhas bases ben deseñadas en C++. C++ é unha linguaxe\n"
"de programación axeitada para o desenvolvemento de escritorio.\n"
"O modelo de obxectos de KDE extende aínda máis a potencia de C++.\n"
"Consulte <a href=\"http://techbase.kde.org/\">http://techbase.kde.org/</a>\n"
"para máis detalles.</p><br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:119
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can use Konqueror to <strong>browse through tar archives</strong>,\n"
"even compressed ones. You can extract files simply by dragging them\n"
"to another place, e.g. another Konqueror window or the desktop.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Pode usar Konqueror para <strong>examinar arquivos tar</strong>,\n"
"mesmo os comprimidos. Pode extraer ficheiros simplemente arrastrándoos\n"
"para outro sitio, p.ex, outra fiestra de Konqueror ou o escritorio.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:127
msgid ""
"<P>\n"
"KDE's help system can display not only KDE's own HTML-based help, but\n"
"also info and man pages.</P>\n"
"<p>For more ways of getting help, see <a\n"
"href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/getting-help.html\">the KDE User\n"
"Guide</a>.</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/actions/help-contents.png\"></center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>\n"
"O sistema de axuda de KDE pode mostrar non só a axuda baseada en HTML de\n"
"KDE, senón tamén as páxinas man e info.</P>\n"
"<p>Para aprender máis acerca dos xeitos de conseguir axuda, consulte <a\n"
"href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/getting-help.html\">a guía do usuario "
"de \n"
"KDE</a>.</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\"></center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:139
msgid ""
"<P>If a toolbar is not large enough to display all buttons on it, you can\n"
"click on the small arrow at the far right end of the toolbar to see\n"
"the remaining buttons.</P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>Se unha barra de ferramentas non é longa dabondo para mostrar todos os "
"botóns\n"
"que contén, pode premer na pequena frecha do extremo dereito da barra para\n"
"ver os botóns restantes.</P>\n"

#: tips.cpp:146
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you need to kill some time, KDE comes with an extensive collection\n"
"of games.</p><br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/categories/applications-games.png\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Se precisa matar algo de tempo, KDE ten unha completa colección de xogos.\n"
"</p><br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/categories/applications-games.png\">\n"

#: tips.cpp:155
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you know its name, you can <strong>execute any program</strong> by "
"pressing\n"
"<strong>Alt+F2</strong>\n"
"and entering the program name in the command-line window provided.<p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/kde.png\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Se sabe o nome, pode <strong>executar calquera programa</strong> premendo\n"
"<strong>Alt+F2</strong> e escrebendo o nome do programa na liña de\n"
"comandos da fiestra que aparece.<p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/kde.png\">\n"

#: tips.cpp:166
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can <strong>browse any URL</strong> by pressing\n"
"<strong>Alt+F2</strong> and entering the URL in the\n"
"command-line window provided.\n"
"</p><br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/places/network-workgroup.png\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Pode <strong>abrir calquer URL</strong> premendo\n"
"<strong>Alt+F2</strong> e introducindo o URL na liña de\n"
"comandos da fiestra que aparece.\n"
"</p><br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"oxygen/48x48/places/network-workgroup.png\">\n"

#: tips.cpp:177
msgid ""
"<p>If you are using Konqueror and want to type another location into\n"
"the location field below the toolbar to get there, you can clear the\n"
"whole field very quickly with the black button with a white cross\n"
"to the left of the \"Location\" label and start typing.</p>\n"
"<p>You can also press Ctrl+L to clear the location field and place the\n"
"text cursor there.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Se está a empregar Konqueror e quere indicar outro lugar no campo de\n"
"localización de debaixo da barra de ferramentas para ir aló, pode limpar\n"
"o campo rapidamente co botón negro cunha cruz branca á esquerda da etiqueta\n"
"de \"Localización\", e comezar despois a escribir.</p>\n"
"<p>Pode tamén premer Ctrl+O para limpar o campo de localización e pór o\n"
"cursor nel.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:187
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you cannot access the titlebar, you can still <strong>move a window</"
"strong>\n"
"on the screen by holding the Alt key, clicking anywhere into the window\n"
"and \"dragging\" it with the mouse.</p><br>\n"
"<p>Of course, you can change this behavior in the System Settings.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Se non pode aceder á barra de título, poderá <strong>mover unha\n"
"fiestra</strong> pola pantalla mantendo premida a tecla Alt, e premendo \n"
"en calquer sitio da fiestra e \"arrastrándoa\" co rato.</p><br>\n"
"<p>Por suposto, pode mudar este comportamento no Centro de control.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:196
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can <strong>resize a window</strong> on the screen by holding the Alt "
"key,\n"
"right-clicking anywhere into the window and moving the mouse.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Pode <strong>redimensionar unha fiestra</strong> na pantalla mantendo a\n"
"tecla Alt, premendo co botón dereito en calquera sitio da fiestra e\n"
"movendo o rato.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:203
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE's mail client (KMail) provides seamless <strong>PGP/GnuPG\n"
" integration</strong>\n"
"for encrypting and signing your email messages.</p>\n"
"<p>See <a href=\"help:/kmail/pgp.html\">the KMail Handbook</a> for\n"
"instructions on setting up encryption.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"O cliente de correo de KDE fornece <strong>integración con PGP/GnuPG</"
"strong> \n"
"para cifrar e asinar as súas mensaxes de correo electrónico.</p>\n"
"<p>Consulte <a href=\"help:/kmail/pgp.html\">o manual de KMail</a> para \n"
"instrucións acerca de como configurar a cifraxe.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:213
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can find KDE developers all over the world, e.g., in Germany,\n"
"Sweden, France, Canada, USA, Australia, Namibia, Argentina, and even in\n"
"Norway!</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"To see where KDE developers can be found, take a look at <a href=\"http://"
"worldwide.kde.org\">worldwide.kde.org</a>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Pode atopar desenvolventes de KDE por todo o mundo, p.ex., na Alemaña,\n"
"Suecia, Franza, Canadá, EUA, Australia, Namibia, Arxentina, e mesmo en\n"
"Noruega!</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Para ver onde pode atopar desenvolventes de KDE, consulte <a href=\"http://"
"worldwide.kde.org\">worldwide.kde.org</a>.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:223
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE's CD player, KsCD, accesses the Internet CD database freedb to provide "
"you\n"
"with title/track information.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Full details of KsCD's functions are available in <a\n"
"href=\"help:/kscd\">the KsCD Handbook</a>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"O reprodutor de CD de KDE, KsCD, acede á base de datos de CDs de Internet \n"
"freedb para darlle información do título e da pista.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Os detalles completos acerca das funcións de KsCD están á súa "
"disposición \n"
"no <a\n"
"href=\"help:/kscd\">Manual de KsCD</a>.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:233
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can change the color of the window titlebars by clicking on the title "
"bar of the\n"
"example window in the <em>Appearance</em> module within the System "
"Settings.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>You can use the other aspects of the example graphic to further customize "
"the appearance of KDE on your computer.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Pode cambiar a cor da barra de título das fiestras premendo na barra de "
"título da fiestra\n"
"do exemplo no módulo <em>Aparencia e temas</em> da Configuración do "
"Sistema.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Pode usar os outros elementos do gráfico de exemplo para personalizar\n"
"aínda máis a aparencia do seu KDE.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:242
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"The difference between window manager styles and old-fashioned themes is\n"
"that the former even reflect window titlebar color settings from the\n"
"System Settings and might implement different features.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"A diferenza entre os estilos do xestor de fiestras e os antigos temas, \n"
"é que os estilos reflicten mesmo a configuración da cor da barra de \n"
"título das fiestras estabelecida na Configuración do Sistema, e poden "
"implementar\n"
"distintas características.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:250
msgid ""
"<p>If you want to know when <b>the next release</b> of KDE is planned,\n"
"look for the release schedule on <a\n"
" href=\"http://techbase.kde.org/\">http://techbase.kde.org</a>. If you only\n"
"find old release schedules, there will probably be some weeks/months of\n"
"intensive development left before the next release.</p><br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Se quere saber para cándo está planexada <b>a vindeira versión</b> de "
"KDE,\n"
"consulte a axenda en <a\n"
" href=\"http://techbase.kde.org/\">http://techbase.kde.org</a>. Se só atopa "
"axendas de versións antigas, haberá probablemente algunhas semanas/meses de\n"
"desenvolvemento intensivo antes da seguinte versión.</p><br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"oxygen/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:260
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Under the <em>\"B II\"</em> window decoration, the title bars\n"
"automatically move by themselves so they are always visible. You can\n"
"edit your title bar decoration by right clicking on your title bar and\n"
"selecting \"Configure Window Behavior...\".</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Na decoración das fiestras <em>\"B II\"</em>, as barras de título\n"
"móvense soas de xeito que estexan sempre visíbeis. Pode editar a \n"
"súa decoración da barra de título premendo co botón dereito na barra \n"
"de título e escollendo \"Configurar o comportamento da fiestra...\".</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:269
msgid ""
"<p>If you do not like the default completion mode (e.g. in Konqueror), you\n"
"can right-click on the edit-widget and choose a different mode, e.g.\n"
"automatic or manual completion. Manual completion works in a similar\n"
"way to\n"
"completion in a UNIX shell. Use Ctrl+E to invoke it.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Se non lle gusta o modo predeterminado de completado, p.ex. en "
"Konqueror,\n"
"pode premer co botón dereito no widget de edición e escoller un modo \n"
"diferente, p.ex. completado automático ou manual. O completado manual \n"
"funciona dun xeito semellante ao completado da shell de UNIX. Empregue \n"
"Ctrl+E para invocalo.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:279
msgid ""
"<p>If you want to contribute your own \"tip of the day\", please send it to\n"
"<a href=\"mailto:kde-doc-english@kde.org\">kde-doc-english@kde.org</a>, and "
"we will be happy to\n"
" include\n"
"it in the next release.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Se quere contribuír cun \"consello do día\", por favor envíeo a\n"
"<a href=\"mailto:kde-doc-english@kde.org\">kde-doc-english@kde.org</a>, e \n"
"incluirémola gostosamente na vindeira versión.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:287
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you drag a file from Konqueror or from the desktop to Konsole, you\n"
"will have the choice between pasting the URL or entering that folder.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Choose the one you want, so you do not have to write the entire path\n"
"in the terminal window.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Se arrastra un ficheiro desde Konqueror ou desde o escritorio a Konsole, "
"terá\n"
"a opción de apegar o URL ou entrar nese cartafol.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Escolla a que queira, de xeito que non teña que escreber a rota completa\n"
"na fiestra da terminal.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:297
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can add your own \"Web Shortcuts\" to Konqueror by selecting\n"
"Settings->Configure Konqueror->Web Shortcuts. Click \"New...\" and\n"
"complete the fields.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>For further instructions, and details about the advanced features\n"
"available with Web Shortcuts, see <a\n"
"href=\"help:/konqueror/enhanced-browsing.html\">the Konqueror Handbook</a>.</"
"p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Michael Lachmann and Thomas Diehl</"
"em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Pode engadir o seu proprio \"Atallo web\" en Konqueror escollendo\n"
"Configuración->Configurar Konqueror->Atallos web. Prema \"Novo...\" e\n"
"complete os campos.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Para máis instrucións e detalles acerca das funcionalidades avanzadas\n"
"disponíbeis cos atallos web, consulte <a\n"
"href=\"help:/konqueror/enhanced-browsing.html\">o Manual de Konqueror</a>.</"
"p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Por Michael Lachmann e Thomas Diehl</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:310
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Each UNIX user has a so-called Home folder in which his or her\n"
"files as well as user-dependent configuration files are saved. If you\n"
"work in a Konsole window, you can easily change to your home folder\n"
"by entering the <b>cd</b> command without any parameters.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Cada usuario de UNIX ten o chamado cartafol Persoal no cal\n"
"garda os seus ficheiros ou ficheiros de configuración. Se traballa nunha \n"
"fiestra de Konsole, pode ir doadamente ao seu cartafol persoal \n"
"introducindo o comando <b>cd</b> sen nengún parámetro.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:320
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You might wonder why there are very few (if any) files whose\n"
"names end in <code>.exe</code> or <code>.bat</code> on UNIX\n"
"systems. This is because filenames on UNIX do not need an\n"
"extension. Executable files in KDE are represented by the gear icon\n"
"in Konqueror. In the Konsole window, they are often colored red\n"
"(depending on your settings).\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Podería estarse a preguntar por qué hai tan poucos (se hai) ficheiros con \n"
"nomes rematados con <code>.exe</code> ou <code>.bat</code> nos sistemas\n"
"UNIX. Isto é porque en UNIX os nomes de ficheiro non precisan dunha\n"
"extensión. Os ficheiros executábeis en KDE represéntanse polo ícona da \n"
"engrenaxe en Konqueror. Na fiestra de Konsole, móstranse a miúdo en "
"vermello \n"
"(dependendo das súas opcións).\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:332
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you want to make your desktop look more interesting, you can find\n"
"additional themes, widget styles, window decorations and more at <a href="
"\"http://kde-look.org/\">kde-look.org</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Se quere facer que o seu escritorio teña outro aspeito, pode atopar\n"
"novos temas en <a href=\"http://www.kde-look.org\">www.kde-look.org</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:340
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Did you know that you can use the middle mouse button to paste\n"
"text? Try selecting some text with the left mouse button and click\n"
"elsewhere with the middle mouse button. The selected text will be\n"
"pasted at the click position. This even works between different programs.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Sabía que pode empregar o botón central do rato para apegar texto?\n"
"Tente a seleccionar algún cacho de texto co botón primario e prema\n"
"onde queira co botón central. O pedazo escollido apegarase\n"
"na posición onde sinalou. Isto funciona mesmo entre programas diferentes.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:350
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you need to calculate a distance on the screen, the program\n"
"<em>kruler</em> can be of great help.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Furthermore, if you need to look closely at the ruler to count single\n"
"pixels, <em>kmag</em> may be very useful. (It is not part of the KDE base\n"
"installation but needs to be installed separately. It might already be\n"
"available on your distribution.) <em>kmag</em> works\n"
"just like <em>xmag</em>, with the difference that it magnifies on the fly.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Jesper Pedersen</em></p><br>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Se precisa calcular unha distancia na pantalla, o programa\n"
"<em>kruler</em> halle de ser de grande utilidade.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Ademáis, se precisa mirar perto da pantalla para contar píxeles soltos\n"
",<em>kmag</em> podería resultarlle axeitado. (Isto non forma parte da \n"
"instalación base de KDE e precisa ser instalado por separado. Debería \n"
"atoparse disponíbel na súa distribución.) <em>kmag</em> funciona\n"
"como <em>xmag</em>, coa diferenza de que el aumenta ao voo.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Por Jesper Pedersen</em></p><br>\n"

#: tips.cpp:365
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can associate sounds, pop up windows, and more with KDE events. This can "
"be configured\n"
"from the System Settings by selecting Notifications.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Pode asociar sons, fiestras emerxentes, e máis con eventos en KDE. Isto \n"
"pódese configurar desde Configuración do Sistema escollendo\n"
"Notificacións.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:373
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE is a fully network transparent environment: you can use network\n"
"URLs in any KDE application. For example, you can enter a URL like\n"
"ftp://www.server.com/myfile in the KWrite Open dialog, and KWrite will\n"
"open the file and save changes back to the FTP server when you click\n"
"on 'Save.'\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE é un sistema totalmente transparente á rede: pode usar URLs\n"
"de rede en calquer programa de KDE. Por exemplo, pode inserir un URL como\n"
"ftp://www.servidor.com/omeuficheiro no diálogo de Abrir ficheiro de KWrite, "
"e \n"
"KWrite abrirá o ficheiro e gardará as mudanzas de volta no servidor FTP "
"cando \n"
"prema en \"Gardar\".\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:384
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can use Konqueror to access your files on any server that you have\n"
"ssh access to. Just enter fish://<em>username</em>@<em>hostname</em> in\n"
"Konqueror's location bar.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"In fact, all KDE applications support fish:// URLs - try entering one\n"
"in the Open dialog of KWrite, for instance.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Pode usar Konqueror para aceder aos seus ficheiro en calquer servidor ao "
"que\n"
"teña acceso ssh. Simplesmente insira fish://<em>usuario</em>@<em>servidor</"
"em> \n"
"na barra de localización de Konqueror.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"De feito, todos os programas de KDE soportan o fish:// - tente inserir un\n"
"no diálogo de abertura de ficheiro de KWrite, por exemplo.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:397
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KMail, the KDE email client, has built-in support for several popular\n"
"spam filtering apps. To set up automatic spam filtering in KMail,\n"
"configure your favorite spam filter as you like it, then go to\n"
"Tools->Anti-spam wizard in KMail.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"For more information, look at <a\n"
"href=\"help:/kmail/the-anti-spam-wizard.html\">the KMail Handbook\n"
"Anti-Spam Wizard chapter</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KMail, o cliente de correo de KDE, ten soporte incorporado para varios\n"
"programas moi populares de filtraxe de correo lixo. Para configurar a\n"
"filtraxe automática do correo lixo en KMail, configure o seu filtro "
"favorito\n"
"como desexe, entón vaia ao asistente Ferramentas->Asistente antispam\n"
"en KMail.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Para máis información, consulte o <a\n"
"href=\"help:/kmail/the-anti-spam-wizard.html\">Manual de KMail\n"
"no capítulo do Asistente anti-spam</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:412
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can make a window go below other windows by middle-clicking on its "
"titlebar.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Pode facer que unha fiestra vaia baixo doutras fiestras premendo co botón "
"central do rato na súa barra de título.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:419
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE applications offer short \"What's This?\" help texts for many\n"
"features. Just click on the question mark on the window titlebar, and\n"
"then click on the item you need help on. (In some themes, the button\n"
"is a lowercase \"i\" instead of a question mark).\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Os programas de KDE ofrecen uns pequenos textos de axuda \"Que é Isto?\" "
"para\n"
"moitas características. Prema na marca de interrogación da barra de título "
"da\n"
"fiestra e logo prema no ítem acerca do que quere obter axuda. (Nalgúns "
"temas, o\n"
"botón é unha \"i\" minúscula, no canto dun sino de interrogación).\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:429
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE supports several different window focus modes: take a look in the\n"
"System Settings under Window Behavior. For example, if you\n"
"use the mouse a lot, you might prefer the \"Focus follows mouse\" setting.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE soporta varios modos de focalización das fiestras: vote unha ollada en\n"
"Configuración do Sistema, en Comportamento da fiestra. Por exemplo,\n"
"se usa moito o rato, podería preferir \"O foco segue ao rato\".\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:438
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Konqueror can continuously scroll webpages up or down: just press\n"
"Shift+Up Arrow or Shift+Down Arrow. Press the key combination again to\n"
"increase the speed, or any other key to stop the scrolling.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Konqueror pode desprazarse de xeito continuo polas páxinas web: prema\n"
"Maiúsc+Cursor arriba ou Maiúsc+Cursor abaixo. Prema a combinación de\n"
"novo para aumentar a velocidade, ou calquer outra tecla para deter o\n"
"desprazamento.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:447
msgid ""
"<p>You can use Konqueror's help:/ kioslave to have quick and easy\n"
"access to an application's handbook by typing <b>help:/</b>, directly\n"
"followed by the application name, in the Location bar. So, for example\n"
"to view the handbook for kwrite simply type help:/kwrite.</p> \n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Pode usar o kioslave help:/ de Konqueror para ter aceso rápido e fácil\n"
"ao manual dun programa escrebendo <b>help:/</b>, seguido do nome do\n"
"programa, na barra de localización. Por exemplo, para ver o manual de "
"kwrite\n"
"simplesmente escreba help:/kwrite.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:455
msgid ""
"<p>Konqueror's Web Shortcuts feature lets you submit a query directly\n"
"to a search engine without having to visit the website\n"
"first. For example, entering <b>gg:konqueror</b> in the Location bar and\n"
"pressing Enter will search Google for items relating to Konqueror.</p>\n"
"<p>To see what further Web Shortcuts are available, and to make your\n"
"own, from Konqueror just select Settings->Configure Konqueror... which\n"
"will open the Settings dialog box, and then just click on the Web\n"
"Shortcuts icon.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Os atallos web de Konqueror permítenlle enviar unha pesquisa "
"directamente\n"
"a un motor de procuras sen ter que visitar antes o sitio web. Por exemplo,\n"
"escrebendo <b>gg:konqueror</b> na barra de localización e premendo Intro\n"
"procurará en Google resultados relativos a Konqueror.</p>\n"
"<p>Para ver que outros atallos web hai disponíbeis, e para engadir o seu\n"
"proprio, desde Konqueror escolla Configuración->Configurar Konqueror...\n"
"que abrirá o diálogo de Configuracion, e prema no ícone dos atallos web.</"
"p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:467
msgid ""
"<p>KDE is always looking to improve its accessibility, and with the\n"
"launch of KTTS (KDE Text-to-Speech) you now have the power to convert\n"
"strings of text into audible speech. </p>\n"
"<p>KTTS is constantly improving, and currently provides support to\n"
"speak all or any portion of plain text files (as viewed in Kate), HTML\n"
"pages in Konqueror, text in the KDE clipboard, as well as speech of\n"
"KDE notifications (KNotify).</p>\n"
"<p>To start the KTTS system, you can either select KTTS in the KDE\n"
"menu, or hit Alt+F2 to run a command and then type <b>kttsmgr</b>. For\n"
"more information on KTTS, check the <a href=\"help:/kttsd\" title=\"KTTSD\n"
"Handbook\">KTTSD Handbook</a>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>KDE está constantemente tentando mellorar a súa acesibilidade, e co\n"
"lanzamento de KTTS (KDE Text-to-Speech) agora pode converter cadeas de\n"
"texto en fala.</p>\n"
"<p>KTTS está constantemente a mellorar, e na actualidade soporta a locución\n"
"de ficheiros de texto simples, páxinas HTML en Konqueror, texto no \n"
"portarretallos, así como as notificacións de KDE (KNotify).</p>\n"
"<p>Para iniciar o sistema KTTS, pode ou escoller KTTS no menú de KDE, ou "
"premer Alt+F2 para executar un comando e escreber <b>kttsmgr</b>. Para "
"obter\n"
"máis informacion acerca de KTTS, consulte o <a href=\"help:/kttsd\" title="
"\"KTTSD\n"
"Handbook\">Manual de KTTSD</a>.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:482
msgid ""
"<p>Though KDE is a very stable desktop environment, programs may\n"
"occasionally freeze or crash, particularly if you are running the\n"
"development version of a program, or a program made by a\n"
"third-party. In this case, you can forcibly kill the program if need\n"
"be.</p>\n"
"<p>Pressing <b>Ctrl+Alt+Esc</b> will bring up the skull-and-crossbones\n"
"cursor, and once you click on a window with it the program will be\n"
"automatically killed. Note, however, that this is an untidy way of\n"
"shutting down the program which may result in data being lost, and\n"
"some partner processes may still remain running. This should only be\n"
"used as a last resort.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Aínda que KDE é un sistema de escritorio moi estábel, en ocasións\n"
"os programas poden pecharse inesperadametne, en particular se está a\n"
"executar a versión de desenvolvimento dun programa, ou un programa\n"
"feito por terceiros. Neste caso, pode pechar á forza o programa se o\n"
"precisa.</p>\n"
"<p>Premendo <b>Ctrl+Alt+Esc</b> mostrará un cursor cunha caveira e osos,\n"
"e unha vez prema nunha fiestra con el o programa será matado "
"automaticamente.\n"
"Lembre, porén, que esta é unha forma basta de pechar o programa que pode\n"
"resultar en perdas de dados, e algúns procesos auxiliares poden seguir\n"
"en execución. Insto só debe ser usado como último recurso.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:497
msgid ""
"<p>KMail is KDE's email client, but did you know that you can\n"
"integrate it -- along with other programs -- to bring them all under\n"
"one roof? Kontact was made to be a Personal Information Management\n"
"suite, and it integrates all components under it seamlessly.</p>\n"
"<p>Other possible programs to integrate with Kontact include\n"
"KAddressBook (for handling Contacts), KNotes (for keeping notes),\n"
"KNode (to keep up-to-date with the latest news), and KOrganizer (for a\n"
"comprehensive calender).</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>KMail é o cliente de correo de KDE, pero sabía que o pode integrar\n"
"--xunto con outros programas -- para telos todos baixo o mesmo envoltorio?\n"
"Kontact foi feito para ser unha suite de Xestión de Información Persoal,\n"
"e integra todas as componentes dun xeito transparente.</p>\n"
"<p>Outros programas que pode integrar con Kontact son KAdressBook (para\n"
"xestionar Contactos), KNotes (para mementos), KNode (para estar á última\n"
"coas novas), e KOrganizer (para dispor dun calendario).</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:509
msgid ""
"<p>By pressing F4 in Konqueror you can open a terminal at your current\n"
"location.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Se preme F4 en Konqueror abrirá unha terminar no lugar actual.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:515
msgid ""
"<p>Although KDE will automatically restore your KDE programs that were\n"
"left open after you logged out, you can specifically tell KDE to start\n"
"particular applications on start up; see the <a\n"
"href=\"help:/khelpcenter/faq/configure.html#id2574142\" title=\"Autostart\n"
"FAQ\">FAQ entry</a> for more information.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Aínda que KDE restaurará automaticamente os seus programas de KDE \n"
"que estivesen abertos a última vez que saíse, pode indicarlle \n"
"especificamente que inicie programas concretos no inicio; consulte <a\n"
"href=\"help:/khelpcenter/faq/configure.html#id2574142\" title=\"Autostart\n"
"FAQ\">as FAQ</a> para máis información.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:524
msgid ""
"<p>You can integrate Kontact, KDE's Personal Information Management\n"
"suit, with Kopete, KDE's Instant Messenger client, so that you can\n"
"view contacts' online status, as well as respond to them easily from\n"
"KMail itself. For a step-by-step guide, check <a\n"
"href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/integrated-messaging.html\"\n"
"title=\"Integrated Messaging\">the KDE User Guide</a>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Pode integrar Kontact, a suite de Xestión de Información Persoal \n"
"de KDE, con Kopete, o cliente de Mensaxeiría Instantánea de KDE, para \n"
"que poda ver o estado de conexón dos contactos, así como responderlles \n"
"facilmente desde o proprio KMail. Para unha guía paso por paso, \n"
"consulte <ahref=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/integrated-messaging.html\"\n"
"title=\"Integrated Messaging\">a guía do usuario de KDE</a>.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:534
msgid ""
"<p>By entering <b>kmail --composer</b> in Konsole you can\n"
"have KMail only open up the composer window, so that you do not have to\n"
"open the entire email client when you only want to send an email to\n"
"someone.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Se escrebe <b>kmail --composer</b> en Konsole fará que KMail \n"
"abra só a fiestra do compositor, polo que non terá que abrir \n"
"todo o cliente de correo electrónica cando só queira enviar un correo a "
"alguén.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:542
msgid ""
"<p>While tabbed browsing in Konqueror is very useful, you can take\n"
"this one step further if you choose to have a split view in order to\n"
"view two locations at the same time. To access this feature, in\n"
"Konqueror select Window->Split View, with either Top-Bottom or\n"
"Left/Right, depending upon your choice.</p>\n"
"<p>This setting will also only apply to a particular tab, rather than\n"
"all tabs you have, so you can choose to have the split view for only\n"
"some of the tabs where you might think it is useful.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Aínda que a navegación por páxinas de Konqueror é moi útil, \n"
"pode levar isto máis aló se escoller ter unha vista partida para\n"
"ver dous sitios á vez. Para aceder a esta funcionalidade, en Konqueror\n"
"escolla Fiestra->Dividir a vista, sexa en horizontal ou vertical,\n"
"á súa escolla.</p>\n"
"<p>Esta opción tamén se aplica a unha só páxina, no canto de a todas\n"
"as que teña, polo que pode escoller dividir a vista de só algunhas\n"
"das páxinas onde lle sexa de utilidade.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:554
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can let KDE turn the <b>NumLock</b> ON or OFF at startup.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Open the System Settings, select Keyboard &amp; Mouse and make your\n"
" choice.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<hr><br><br>\n"
"<i>This is the last tip in the tips database. Clicking \"Next\" will take "
"you back to\n"
" the first tip.</i>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Pode permitir que KDE acenda ou apague o <b>bloqueo de maiúsculas</b> no "
"inicio.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Abra Configuración do Sistema, escolla Teclado e Rato e escolla por si "
"mesmo.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<hr><br><br>\n"
"<i>Esta é a última axudiña na base de datos de consellos. Se preme en "
"\"Seguinte\" voltará á primeira.</i>\n"
"</p>\n"

